.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH cog-init 1  "cog-init " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
cog\-init \- Install cog config files
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBcog\-init\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATH\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Install cog config files
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATH\fR] [default: .]
Path to initialized dir
